A restaurant kitchen

A `Waiter` sends tickets to the `Kitchen display`. The `Grill cook` and the
`Salad cook` read the `Kitchen display`. Both hand plates to the `Pass`, and
the `Waiter` collects from the `Pass`.
---
Waiter -> Kitchen display: ticket
Grill cook, Salad cook -> Kitchen display: read
Grill cook, Salad cook -> Pass: plate
Waiter -> Pass: collect
